# text = 2:39 > Kuʻu Wā Liʻiliʻi Hoʻomanaʻo aʻela ala wau I kuʻu wā liʻiliʻi Kapa ʻia mai au he hūpēkole A nui aʻe he wahine uʻi Hoʻomanaʻo aʻela ala wau I kuʻu wā liʻiliʻi Kapa ʻia maila au he hūpēkole kole A nui aʻe he wahine uʻi Hānai ʻia au a nui puʻipuʻi I ka nui miki ʻai a Tūtū ʻAi a māʻona, a inu a kena Ke aloha ia o nā kūpuna A nui aʻela ala au Ma hea e hōʻea ana ʻo ia ala Ka milimili me kahi sweet oil A lilo ana au ia iā ala Hāʻina ʻia mai ka puana Hoʻomanaʻo aʻela au i kuʻu wā liʻiliʻi Kapa ʻia mai au he hūpēkole A nui aʻe he wahine uʻi Aloha nō kēia leo kaulana i aloha nui ʻia e kākou a pau ma Hawaiʻi nei.
